  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">전기 실험할 때 집게 전선의 손잡이 부분이 빠져나가는 경우 있으시죠? 볼펜만 있으면 간단히 원상복구가 가능하답니다. </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1. 집게를 볼펜의 끝부분에 끼운다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2. 집게의 위쪽 부분이 오므라들면 손잡이 부분을 살짝 밀어 넣고 볼펜을 뺀다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">끝입니다. ^^</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eae63a9d3c966543c6a3bd3ca01d3a82c7220bf3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eae63a9d3c966543c6a3bd3ca01d3a82c7220bf3\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf99a93f364cbc3f7c88e85410c32ffc065958ea\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf99a93f364cbc3f7c88e85410c32ffc065958ea\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/20a163ad8b8afa3e08ba860f293fe3185589d66e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/20a163ad8b8afa3e08ba860f293fe3185589d66e\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7dafecb5fc3d8faa0c0be6eedb43d39e7c3dd2a3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7dafecb5fc3d8faa0c0be6eedb43d39e7c3dd2a3\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
